OL,3,GNEWSASchool 'devastated' after death of
OL,4,Agirl, 12, hit by bus
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Ayrshire school said its community
OL,7,Fhas been left "devastated" by the death
OL,8,Fof a 12-year-old pupil after she was
OL,9,Fhit by a Stagecoach bus.
OL,11,FThe girl, who has not been named, was
OL,12,Fpronounced dead at the scene after the
OL,13,Fincident, which happened at Lauchlan
OL,14,FWay in Kilwinning about 13:10 on
OL,15,FTuesday.
OL,17,FNorth Ayrshire Council said the girl
OL,18,Fwas a pupil of Kilwinning Academy and
OL,19,F"known for her bright smile, vibrant
OL,20,Fpersonality and helpful nature".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
